# Local skill catalog snapshot.
#
# `npm run skills:ingest` materializes this directory from the operator's own
# ~/.agents/skills and ~/.codex/skills. Those packages are third-party content
# owned by their respective authors and are deliberately NOT redistributed by
# this repository. Each machine builds its own catalog from skills it already
# has a licence to use. See docs/SKILL-CATALOG.md.
apps/desktop/resources/skills/

